10:14: error: this literal is 2 characters, and a literal of Char is exactly one
11:15: error: an empty string is not a character, and a literal of CodeUnit is exactly one
12:16: error: U+00E9 is not ASCII, and a literal of U8 is one ASCII character - the value of any other is not a unit of UTF-8
13:15: error: U+00E9 is not ASCII, and a literal of CodeUnit is one ASCII character - the value of any other is not a unit of UTF-8
14:17: error: U+00E9 is not ASCII, and a literal of I8 is one ASCII character - the value of any other is not a unit of UTF-8
15:17: error: U+1F600 is outside the Basic Multilingual Plane, so it is two UTF-16 units and not one U16
16:15: error: U+AC00 does not fit in I16
17:20: error: U+D800 is a surrogate - half of a UTF-16 pair and not a character - so it is not a Char
18:15: error: U+DFFF is a surrogate - half of a UTF-16 pair and not a character - so it is not a U32
